window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Cooking has always been my passion, but at forty-nine years old, I’ve come to terms with the fact that not everyone can appreciate a truly magnificent dish.</p> <p>Until I walked straight into the magical world of Innothlig.</p> <p>Here, the gods are worshiped through food, and only the most talented chefs can hold their own at the prestigious and highly competitive cooking academies.</p> <p>I don’t know how I ended up in this world, or how I’m suddenly back in my twenty-five-year-old body.</p> <p>All I know is that these fantastical women are gorgeous, the magic is wilder than I could have imagined, and life is going to be absolutely delicious from here on out.</p>"; 
